DAILY DRILLING REPORT - WELL NHK-118
Formation: Barail Main Formation
Depth: 2950.0 m
Event: Heavy Mud Loss of 60 bbl/hr due to natural fractures in Barail lower sand.
Mitigation: Pumped 40 bbl LCM pill containing coarse nutplug and calcium carbonate. Reduced pump pressure.
Outcome: Losses cured after 8 hours.
